# An ask: a wanderer who's been bitten. The antidote is always given, never taken (the built
# "Give them your antidote"). Mercy, not jokes.

conv wanderer.bitten.arm
for wanderer
when wbitten
topic "Ask about the arm."
prio ask
voice plain

node start
  say "Don't. I know what it is. I've seen enough of them to know."
  say "There's a house near enough, if I walk fast. Or there's nothing. I'm still deciding which."
  > @give "Take my antidote." -> given   do call:slot:2
  > @house "Get to a house. Declare it." -> house
  > @sit "I'll sit with you a minute." -> sit

node given
  say "You'd give me that. To me. I don't know what to say."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node house
  say "They'll help if they can. That's the rule. I'll go now, while my legs still work."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node sit
  say "Thank you. Nobody's sat with me since the roads closed. Tell me something ordinary."
  > @weather "The weather's turning." -> weather

node weather
  say "It is. Good. That's what I wanted."
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub
